{{!
    @template local_oksigeniaeguahe/panel_howto_answer

    One answer of «How is it done?»: a task or a setting, its first step (or, marked, what it waits for), its value now
    for a setting, and where to go; inside an item of a list. The script of the panel draws the same in the sheet of
    the bar.

    Example context (json):
    {"key": "costs", "setting": true, "kind": "Ajuste", "text": "Lo que cuesta", "value": "sí",
        "sub": "En «Ajustes», «Lo que cuesta».", "wait": false, "url": "#", "go": "Cambiar", "help": false}
}}
<div class="como-r{{#setting}} como-ajuste{{/setting}}">
    <span class="como-tipo">{{kind}}</span>
    <a class="como-titulo" href="{{url}}">{{text}}</a>
    {{#value}}<span class="como-valor">{{#str}}panel_howto_now, local_oksigeniaeguahe{{/str}}: {{value}}</span>{{/value}}
    <p class="como-sub{{#wait}} como-espera{{/wait}}">{{sub}}</p>
    <a class="boton secundario pequeno" href="{{url}}" tabindex="-1" aria-hidden="true">{{go}}</a>
</div>
